#Note: There are two options for denoising data from within QIIME. We're going to use Dada.
#Note: THIS STEP MAY TAKE DAYS TO RUN. 
#Note: Make sure to set your thread count at an appropriate # relative to your machine's capabilities, otherwise it may run for a few minutes and then error out with some obscure message that you may not necessarily recognize is related to your thread count.

